title Vinyl 0.8.0: Add a network folder (Add boards): the form opens typing the server; typed fields, Enter to the next; Check and add (the scenes' helper answers ok after 700 ms: the sudo prompt is the toolkit's and not in the harness), the progress line, then Music folders with the new share and the notice
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library
env VINYL_DEMO_SHARES 1
keyboards 1
wait 1200
key m
wait 500
tap "Library"
wait 700
tap "Music folders"
wait 900
tap "Add a network folder"
wait 500
shot 01-form-empty
expect text "SERVER (IP OR NAME)"
expect text "SHARE NAME"
expect text "Guest"
expect text "Check and add"
expect text "Read only. Vinyl checks the share before it adds it."
type 192.168.68.142
key enter
type home-music
wait 200
shot 02-typed
tap "Check and add"
wait 300
shot 03-checking
expect text "Asking for the password, then checking 192.168.68.142 (up to 10 s)..."
wait 1200
shot 04-added
expect text "Added. Scanning home-music."
expect text "home-music"
expect noquit
